      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "° Open the Elyra Pipeline Editor\n\n° Optionally, review the the pipeline configuration :\n    - Have a loook to the Runtime Image that will be used for each Pipeline step \n    - See that Environment Variables ( to access S3 ) will be available for each Pipeline Step\n\n° Optionally, look at the Runtime Configuration\n    - Review where Elyra will send the Pipeline Definition\n      ie to the Openshift AI DSPA route ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "° Open the Elyra Pipeline Editor\n\n° Optionally, review the the pipeline configuration :\n    - Have a loook to the Runtime Image that will be used for each Pipeline step \n    - See that Environment Variables ( to access S3 ) will be available for each Pipeline Step\n\n° Optionally, look at the Runtime Configuration\n    - Review where Elyra will send the Pipeline Definition\n      ie to the Openshift AI DSPA route ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
